sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户
    participant Boot as index.html 启动脚本
    participant Store as useThemeStore
    participant Body as document.body
    participant CSS as theme.scss (6 组选择器)
    participant TP as ThemeProvider
    participant Palette as palette.ts
    participant Naive as n-config-provider / naive-ui
    participant View as 业务组件

    Note over User,View: 链路 A · 首屏防 FOUC + 主题渲染（preset × mode 正交）

    User->>Boot: 打开应用（Vue 尚未 mount）
    Boot->>Boot: 同步读 localStorage['fls:theme']
    Boot->>Body: classList.toggle('dark-mode', resolveDark)
    Boot->>Body: dataset.themePreset = preset || 'junior'
    Body-->>CSS: 首帧即命中 6 组选择器之一 → 无闪色

    User->>Store: setPreset('senior') / setTheme('dark') / setFontSize('large')
    Store->>Store: actualTheme = computed(mode)
    Store->>Store: persist() → localStorage['fls:theme']
    Store->>Body: watchEffect: classList + dataset.themePreset
    Body-->>CSS: 命中 body[data-theme-preset=senior].dark-mode (0,2,1)
    TP->>Store: 读取 preset / actualTheme / fontSize
    TP->>Palette: palette.presets[preset][mode]
    Palette-->>TP: 数值色板（6 组之一）
    TP->>TP: buildThemeOverrides(palette, preset, mode, FONT_SIZE_MAPS[fontSize])
    TP->>Naive: :theme-overrides / :theme=darkTheme
    Naive-->>View: naive-ui 组件按数值重绘
    CSS-->>View: var(--x) 自动刷新（无 JS 参与）
    View-->>User: 学段配色 × 明暗 一致渲染

    Note over User,View: 链路 A2 · 按年级自动推荐（A1-3）

    TP->>Store: reconcilePreset(packageStore.packages[].manifest)
    Store->>Store: if presetManual === false
    Store->>Store: inferPreset(manifests) → 众数/并列取最新/空则 junior
    Store->>Store: setPreset(inferred)（不置 manual）
    User->>Store: 手动切换 → setPreset(p, manual=true)
    Store-->>User: 永久停止覆盖；提供 restoreAuto()

    Note over User,View: 链路 B · 一致性测试（2 组 → 6 组，防双源漂移）

    User->>PaletteConsistencyTest: npm test (vitest)
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>theme_scss: readFileSync(theme.scss)
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>PaletteConsistencyTest: extractBlock(6 选择器)
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>PaletteConsistencyTest: 合成生效表（模拟继承：preset 覆盖 :root / dark-mode）
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>PaletteConsistencyTest: normalizeColor(hex|rgba|gradient)
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>palette_ts: palette.presets[p][m]
    PaletteConsistencyTest->>PaletteConsistencyTest: 断言 A 数值一致 + B 齐全 + C 结构(键集合相等/组合块存在) + D buildThemeOverrides
    PaletteConsistencyTest-->>User: 绿=无漂移 / 红=preset.mode.field + 两值

    Note over User,View: 链路 C · 成就结算 + 新解锁动效（A2）

    User->>View: 作答（TopicDetail / ExamPanel / VocabDrill）
    View->>useUserDataStore: recordProgress(...)（×KP）
    useUserDataStore->>streak_module: touchStudyDay(now)
    View->>useUserDataStore: recordAnswerEvent({type, exerciseId})（题目级，一次）
    useUserDataStore->>dailyStats_module: bumpDailyStats({count:1})（内存 + 1500ms 防抖）
    dailyStats_module-->>useUserDataStore: (异步) flushDailyStats() → db.settings
    User->>Home: 返回首页 onMounted
    Home->>useUserDataStore: loadUserData()
    Home->>achievements_module: syncAchievements(ctx{progress,mistakes,streak,packages,dailyStats,attemptedTypes})
    achievements_module->>achievements_module: evaluateAchievements + normalizeUnlocked(兼容 string[])
    achievements_module-->>Home: { unlocked, newlyUnlocked }
    Home->>AchievementToast: 展示新解锁徽章卡（respect prefers-reduced-motion）
    AchievementToast-->>User: 回弹动效 / 静态（reduced-motion）

    Note over User,View: 链路 D · JS 取色统一（B2/B3，组件不 import palette）

    View->>useThemeTokens: tokens（getComputedStyle 读 --x 真值）
    View->>useChartTheme: chartTheme（echarts 轴/文字/tooltip/色块）
    useChartTheme-->>View: 随 preset/mode 重绘
    View->>pdfExporter: exportReportAsPDF(el)
    pdfExporter->>pdfExporter: 临时去 dark-mode / force-light → 截图 → 恢复（固定浅色）
